*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Devices Simulator experimental CUPS compatibility printer
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "LULWBRO.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Devices Simulator"
*Product: "(Lulwa SIM Brother)"
*ModelName: "Lulwa SIM Brother Dual Tray"
*NickName: "Lulwa SIM Brother PDF Capture"
*ShortNickName: "Lulwa SIM Brother"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "12"
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/jpeg image/jpeg 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/png image/png 0 -"
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter: "0 0 612 792"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*OpenUI *InputSlot/Paper Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Tray1
*InputSlot Tray1/Tray 1: "<</MediaPosition 0>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Tray2/Tray 2: "<</MediaPosition 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *InputSlot
